Return the dedup-retained-coverage-v3 structure in one json fence.

COMPARE THE COMPLETE PROPOSITION BEFORE CHOOSING ITS RESULT
The inventory splits sentences into shared and unique fragments. Reconstruct
the whole clause from both, then compare its actual opposite meaning.
In coverage_explanation briefly state the retained proposition or harmless element,
the opposite counterpart, and why meaning is or is not preserved. Use relevant IDs.
No long internal debate. After checking the evidence choose the final status.
Never call a real loss harmless simply to avoid giving evidence.

